      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DANCE WITH ROXY (2) turned in an uncharacteristically poor run most recently when 35 metres away in sixth over 1690m at Maryborough. Form prior to that had been solid. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. Meets a comparable field and she is capable of a much better performance. OSCAROO (5) is a three-year-old gelding by Classic Connection from Fling About on debut. Trial winner who looks above average. Sure to prove tough to beat. ROYAL LADY NZ (1) is on the radar after her last-start fifth over 1710m at Ballarat three weeks ago. HEAVENLY GLOW (9) could only manage tenth when resuming over 1690m at Maryborough last start after breaking in the score up after having finished fourth two runs back. Can do better.",
